    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/bb60ceaa87d139efd5c2727a48addf80.poster.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/bb60ceaa87d139efd5c2727a48addf80.webm?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/bb60ceaa87d139efd5c2727a48addf80.mp4?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u201cThe gladiatorial school embodied the entirety of gladiator life. It was managed by the Lanista, often a former gladiator, who oversaw the daily activities and operations.\u201d</strong></i></h2><br><strong>LANISTA: Shadows and Dust</strong> is a classic-inspired <strong>tactical roguelike</strong> that mixes <strong>ancient Roman history</strong> with a pinch of <strong>post-apocalyptic bloodsports</strong>.<br><br>It is a <strong>loot-driven, perma-death, gladiator arena</strong> where you climb the ranks of a dystopian society through <strong>blood, glory... and cybernetics</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/50152aea2e8ccfd78e5d9cd9e086ee32.poster.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/50152aea2e8ccfd78e5d9cd9e086ee32.webm?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/50152aea2e8ccfd78e5d9cd9e086ee32.mp4?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/dfa1ce56742657182c6e4089f93f762f.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=300 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/8ba56300f4332eb0fd96159c552acf78.poster.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/8ba56300f4332eb0fd96159c552acf78.webm?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/8ba56300f4332eb0fd96159c552acf78.mp4?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The year is 3027, half a century after the <strong>Great Drought</strong> turned the last of Earth\u2019s oceans into a barren desert of salt and sand.<br><br>What was once a highly advanced, technological society - strictly driven by science and striving for progress - quickly devolved into the most primitive, savage representation of a hunger-driven humanity, when answers were sought but science had none left to give.<br><br>Rome now stands as the last bastion of civilization, but with resources dwindling and the future of humanity on the line, scientists turned back to the most basic of principles: <strong>Natural Selection</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u201cUnder extreme circumstances, only those most adapted to their environment shall survive.\u201d</strong></i></h2><br>This simple idea led to the resurgence of an ancient breed of combat bloodsports, and a renewed meaning to the title of <strong>Gladiator</strong>. Along came the <strong>Lanistas</strong>, the strategic overlords that both rule and guide the Gladiators to victory, sharing in both their glory and rewards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;The fittest must survive. The strongest will be fed. The fiercest shall lead.&quot;</strong></i></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/f6fb4a4234aeca75369123b03a42bab6.poster.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/f6fb4a4234aeca75369123b03a42bab6.webm?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/f6fb4a4234aeca75369123b03a42bab6.mp4?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You are a Lanista. It is your duty to<strong> train</strong>, <strong>equip</strong> and <strong>manage</strong> your Gladiators in order for them to rise above the competition, as you dictate their actions even during combat.<br><br>Through the power of <strong>coin</strong>, <strong>influence</strong> and <strong>strategic prowess</strong>, your goal is to command your fleshy pawns as they hack and slash their way through the daily (and deadly) fights at the arena, and attempt to overcome the mighty <strong>Tournaments</strong> that represent an opportunity for glory, as well as your next meal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/38c125863bb8c7fc1fbf2f7ad4ea0aa7.poster.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/38c125863bb8c7fc1fbf2f7ad4ea0aa7.webm?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/38c125863bb8c7fc1fbf2f7ad4ea0aa7.mp4?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As your Gladiator grows in <strong>power and fame</strong>, you will be presented the opportunity to participate in deadly <strong>Tournaments</strong>.<br><br>A mere 10 of these events are what stands between you and eternal glory, with each Tournament representing a <strong>new tier of difficulty, loot rarity, boss fights and new playable classes to unlock</strong> - but winning a Tournament is no easy feat, for victory shall be measured in severed limbs and lifeless corpses left behind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/91fdf1911e4a7692e4d0af6e2da07149.poster.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/91fdf1911e4a7692e4d0af6e2da07149.webm?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/91fdf1911e4a7692e4d0af6e2da07149.mp4?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Featuring <strong>over 18 classes</strong> of Gladiator, these castes may be the baseline that defines your pawn\u2019s fighting style, but it will be the combination of equipment, training, abilities and strategy that define your success as a Lanista.<br><br>With a huge assortment of <strong>rarity-driven equipment</strong>, over <strong>13 weapon archetypes</strong>, <strong>40 active abilities</strong>, more than <strong>160 unique ability combinations</strong> and even a challenging <strong>Auto-battler mode</strong>, you are in control of the threads of fate that intertwine your path to success - even if that means your fleshy pawns won\u2019t live to share the spoils.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embrace the arena. Become the LANISTA.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/bb60ceaa87d139efd5c2727a48addf80.poster.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/bb60ceaa87d139efd5c2727a48addf80.webm?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/bb60ceaa87d139efd5c2727a48addf80.mp4?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>\u201cThe gladiatorial school embodied the entirety of gladiator life. It was managed by the Lanista, often a former gladiator, who oversaw the daily activities and operations.\u201d</strong></i></h2><br><strong>LANISTA: Shadows and Dust</strong> is a classic-inspired <strong>tactical roguelike</strong> that mixes <strong>ancient Roman history</strong> with a pinch of <strong>post-apocalyptic bloodsports</strong>.<br><br>It is a <strong>loot-driven, perma-death, gladiator arena</strong> where you climb the ranks of a dystopian society through <strong>blood, glory... and cybernetics</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/50152aea2e8ccfd78e5d9cd9e086ee32.poster.avif?t=1743687778\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/50152aea2e8ccfd78e5d9cd9e086ee32.webm?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894330/extras/50152aea2e8ccfd78e5d9cd9e086ee32.mp4?t=1743687778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com